# create 
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123

{
    "title": "Lunch",
    "amount": 150.00,
    "category": "food",
    "payment": "card"
}

# list
### List all my expenses
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123


# retrieve

### Retrieve one expense
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/expenses/3/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123


### Update an expense
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/expenses/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123

{
    "title": "Lunch at restaurant"
}


### Delete an expense
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/expenses/2/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123


#filtering
###
### Filter by category
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/?category=food
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123

### Filter by payment
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/?payment=upi
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123

### Filter by both
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/?category=food&payment=upi
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123


#searching expenses

### Get all food expenses
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/?category=food
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123

### Get UPI expenses
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/?payment=upi
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123

### Get card expenses
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/?payment=
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123



##ordering


### Sort by amount (ascending)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/?ordering=amount
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123


### Sort by amount (descending)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/?ordering=-amount
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123


### Sort by creation date (oldest first)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/?ordering=created_at
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123


### Sort by creation date (newest first)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/?ordering=-created_at
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123

### Food expenses, search Lunch, highest amount first
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/create/?category=food&search=Lunch&ordering=-amount
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:Basic admin:admin123
